  "description": "Our current adventure catalogue includes two flagship modules. The first, **Lost Mine of Phandelver** (ID\u202flmop\u2011001), is part of the *Starter Set* line and carries the Adventurers League identifier AL01. It is designed for an average party level of\u202f1 and is estimated to run for exactly\u202f4h (minimum\u202f4\u202fhours, maximum\u202f4\u202fhours). The module was published on **2014-07-15**, appears first in its source (published order\u202f1), and its cover art can be viewed at\u202fhttps://example.com/covers/lmop.jpg. The adventure spans levels\u202f1\u202fthrough\u202f5 and its contents are organized as follows:  \n\n- **Chapter\u202f1: Goblin Arrows** (ordinal\u202fchapter\u202f1) opens with an \u201cIntroduction\u201d and includes a depth\u20112 section titled \u201cEncounter: Goblin Ambush\u201d.  \n- **Appendix\u202fA: Monsters** (ordinal\u202fappendix\u202f\u201cA\u201d) provides supplemental monster statistics.\n\nThe second entry, **Curse of Strahd** (ID\u202fcos\u2011001), belongs to the *Curse of Strahd* storyline. It targets an average Adventurers League player level of\u202f5 and its playtime is variable, ranging from\u202f10\u202fto\u202f15\u202fhours (exact length noted as \u201cvaried\u201d). This module is marked as suitable for \u201cAll Levels\u201d in its custom level field. It was released on **2016-03-15**, holds published order\u202f3 within its source, and its cover image is available at\u202fhttps://example.com/covers/cos.jpg. Its table of contents includes:  \n\n- **Chapter\u202f1: Into the Mists** (no ordinal specified).  \n- **Chapter\u202f2: The Village of Barovia** (ordinal\u202fchapter\u202f2)."
